#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:222
msgid ""
"The node writes ``daemon.log`` in its data directory. ``anet logs`` "
"prints the last 80 lines; ``anet logs 200`` prints 200, and ``anet logs "
"--all`` prints the whole file. A node run by systemd also writes to the "
"journal. The log holds operational messages and no task content."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:227
msgid ""
"``anet audit`` reads the node's evidence chain and checks every record. "
"It needs no daemon."
