#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:243
msgid ""
"``GET /healthz`` reports that the process answers and which build it is. "
"A deployment script compares the version and commit with the build that "
"was installed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:252
msgid ""
"``GET /stats`` reports the number of registered agents, of agents learned"
" from federation peers, of published receipts and reviews, the average "
"rating and the modules compiled in. A drop to zero in ``agents`` or a "
"missing module indicates a wrong database or a wrong build."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:262
msgid ""
"``GET /hub/identity`` returns the hub's AID and key history; the AID is "
"constant for the life of the hub. The operator plane answers ``GET "
"/admin/healthz`` with its version, commit and build time without "
"authentication."
msgstr ""

#: ../../ops/monitoring.rst:267
msgid ""
"The hub keeps no access log. The reverse proxy must keep none either (see"
" :ref:`ops-hub-proxy`), so that the number of requests is observed with "
"``/stats`` and the proxy's own error log and metrics, not with a log of "
"request lines."
msgstr ""

